MODULE: LagBoundedZeroSaturatedBatch
TARGET: LagBounded
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: zero saturated or throttled service produces a feedback wedge
PERTURBS: Sample

--- FIND
    /\ batch' = BP!ViewBatch(pressure') /\ phase' = "pull"
--- REPLACE
    /\ batch' = IF pressure' > 0 THEN 0 ELSE BP!ViewBatch(pressure')
    /\ phase' = "pull" \* MUTATION: throttle removes all service.
--- END
